WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
Why is a person blind?

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,300
My father taught me this when I was a child

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,300
When we grew up, we often corresponded

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,300
He said life is like a piano

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,300
Some sacrifices are made in order to get something more important

6
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,300
But I can never see him again

7
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:19,580
I just missed him a little tonight

8
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,580
if you don't mind

9
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:24,990
I'll accompany you on the next sentence

10
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:34,380
thank you sir

11
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:36,380
Keep calling me sir

12
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,380
don't you know me

13
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,380
I have just come to the base and have been working in the logistics department.

14
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,380
After my parents had an accident, the base saved me.
